                  "content": "Usage audit — this board is honest, not aspirational. Light roles consume cream/terra/umber (editorial parchment); dark roles consume ink/green (terminal lime). The ENTIRE blue accent family and most neutrals are now unused — the Wave-1 tokens issue prunes them (neutral survives only as styles.css raw usage, the flagged violation). Dimmed steps have no consumer. State families ARE consumed — raw, by the seed's Badge/Button variants: Wave 1 adds --color-{success,warning,danger}-{surface,fg} roles, and the postcss test then enforces: every raw step consumed by a role, zero --c- references outside tokens.css.",
                  "lineHeight": 1.4,
                  "fontFamily": "$font-body",
                  "fontSize": 11,
                  "fontWeight": "normal"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
